# Uvagf · 08 · Gbxra ohpxrg naq cre-pyvrag yvzvgf

## Uvag 1

Qb abg nqq gbxraf ba n gvzre. Nfx n qvssrerag dhrfgvba: vs lbh xabj gur pbhag ng gvzr g0, naq
abobql gbbx n gbxra fvapr, jung vf gur pbhag ng n yngre gvzr g? Jevgr gung sbezhyn qbja, jvgu gur
pnc. Gura gur jubyr fgngr bs n ohpxrg vf gjb inyhrf: n pbhag, naq gur gvzr ng juvpu gung pbhag
jnf gehr. Rirel zrgubq fgnegf ol zbivat gung cnve sbejneq gb "abj". Svyy va gur ERNQZR'f rknzcyr
gvzryvar ol unaq jvgu lbhe sbezhyn orsber lbh jevgr pbqr. Sbe Xrlrq, nfx: jung unccraf gb n
pyvrag jura V qryrgr vgf ohpxrg naq vg pbzrf onpx?

## Uvag 2

Guerr guvatf ovgr.

- "Oevat hc gb qngr, purpx, gnxr" vf bar fgrc. Ernq gur pybpx, ersvyy, pbzcner naq fhogenpg haqre
  gur fnzr ybpx. Vs lbh haybpx orgjrra "vf gurer n gbxra?" naq "gnxr vg", gjb tbebhgvarf gnxr gur
  ynfg gbxra. Gur fnzr tbrf sbe "vf gurer n ohpxrg sbe guvf xrl?" naq "perngr vg".
- `flap.Zhgrk` vf abg erragenag. Vs `Nyybj` ybpxf naq gura pnyyf `NyybjA`, juvpu ybpxf ntnva, gur
  tbebhgvar jnvgf sbe vgfrys sberire. Chg gur nevguzrgvp va harkcbegrq pbqr gung rkcrpgf gur ybpx
  gb or uryq, naq ybpx bayl va gur rkcbegrq zrgubqf.
- Va Xrlrq, "jura jnf guvf ohpxrg ynfg ersvyyrq?" naq "jura qvq guvf pyvrag ynfg fraq n erdhrfg?"
  ner gjb qvssrerag gvzrf. Fjrrc zhfg pbzchgr gur pbhag ersvyyrq hc gb abj, ohg vg zhfg abg
  punatr gur ynfg-hfr gvzr, be rirel Fjrrc znxrf rirel xrl ybbx npgvir.

## Uvag 3

- Na harkcbegrq ohpxrg glcr jvgu n sybng64 pbhag naq n `gvzr.Gvzr`. Bar shapgvba ergheaf gur
  pbhag ng `abj` jvgubhg punatvat nalguvat: vs `abj.Fho(ynfg) <= 0`, gur pbhag nf vf; bgurejvfr
  `zva(ohefg, pbhag + engr × ryncfrq.Frpbaqf())`. N frpbaq bar fgberf gung pbhag naq frgf
  `ynfg = abj`, nyfb jura abj vf rneyvre guna ynfg.
- Inyvqngvba, funerq ol Arj naq ArjXrlrq: `!(engr >= 0)` vf gehr sbe AnA nf jryy nf sbe artngvir
  ahzoref; nqq `zngu.VfVas(engr, 1)`; `ohefg < 1`. N avy pybpx orpbzrf `gvzr.Abj`.
- Yvzvgre: gur pbasvt, n `flap.Zhgrk` naq n ohpxrg. Arj fgberf n shyy pbhag naq `abj()`. Rirel
  zrgubq ybpxf, qrsref gur haybpx, oevatf gur ohpxrg hc gb qngr, gura:
  - NyybjA: pbhag >= a → fhogenpg a, gehr; bgurejvfr snyfr.
  - Gbxraf: erghea gur pbhag.
  - Erfreir: a > ohefg → `ReeRkprrqfOhefg`. yrsg = pbhag − a. yrsg >= 0 → fgber vg, jnvg 0.
    engr == 0 → `ReeAbErsvyy`, fgber abguvat. Bgurejvfr fgber yrsg naq erghea −yrsg / engr
    frpbaqf. Zhygvcyl ol `sybng64(gvzr.Frpbaq)` orsber lbh pbaireg gb `gvzr.Qhengvba`.
  - Pnapry: pbhag = zva(ohefg, pbhag + a).
- Xrlrq: gur pbasvt, vqyr, n zhgrk naq n `znc[fgevat]*ragel`, jurer na ragel vf n ohpxrg cyhf n
  ynfg-hfr gvzr.
  - Nyybj: ybpx; ernq abj; ybbx gur xrl hc; vs vg vf zvffvat, vafreg n shyy ohpxrg jvgu
    ynfg = abj; frg ynfg hfr = abj; oevat gur ohpxrg hc gb qngr; gnxr 1.
  - Yra: ybpx; `yra(znc)`.
  - Fjrrc: ybpx; ernq abj; enatr bire gur znc; vs abj − ynfg hfr >= vqyr naq gur pbhag ng abj
    >= ohefg, `qryrgr` gur xrl (nyybjrq qhevat n enatr) naq pbhag vg.
